@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam DefaultFontSize 15
mainframe sd WriteCsvAtomically
participant "<<class>>\nCsvAddressBookExporter" as Exporter STORAGE_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nFileUtil" as FileUtil STORAGE_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nFiles" as Files STORAGE_COLOR
[-> Exporter : export(people, targetPath)
activate Exporter
Exporter -> FileUtil : writeAtomically(targetPath, writer)
activate FileUtil
FileUtil -> Files : createTempFile(targetParent, prefix, suffix)
Files --> FileUtil : temporary
FileUtil -> Exporter : writer callback: writeCsv(people, temporary)
activate Exporter
note over Exporter
Write the UTF-8 header and all records.
Sort tags; use CSV quoting for field values.
Close the writer before returning.
end note
Exporter --> FileUtil : return
deactivate Exporter
FileUtil -> Files : move(temporary, target, ATOMIC_MOVE, REPLACE_EXISTING)
Files --> FileUtil : return
FileUtil --> Exporter : return
deactivate FileUtil
Exporter -->[ : return
deactivate Exporter
note over FileUtil,Files
Success path shown. On write/move failure,
attempt temporary-file cleanup and rethrow.
The previous destination is preserved.
end note
@enduml
